{
  "slug": "expo",
  "name": "Expo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Expo skills for building, deploying, upgrading, and debugging React Native apps with Expo. Covers UI development with Expo Router, SwiftUI and Jetpack Compose components, Tailwind CSS setup, API routes, data fetching, CI/CD workflows, App Store and Play Store deployment, SDK upgrades, DOM components, and dev client distribution.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **24 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (24): `eas-app-stores` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-hosting` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-observe` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-simulator` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-update` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-update-insights` (EAS service (paid)), `eas-workflows` (EAS service (paid)), `expo-animation` (Framework (OSS)), and 16 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `UserPromptExpansion`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `expo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install expo@claude-plugins-official` from `expo/skills` (`plugins/expo`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 24,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
